The latter is funded by groups such as Monsanto, Nestlé or Bayer.
Mr. Kuiper worked decisively in the development of the Efsa test requirements for genetically modified plants and, as a result, was clearly in a conflict of interest situation, according to critics made made by Mr. Then.
The requirements developed correspond verbatim, by sub-paragraph, to the positions of the Ilsi Pressure Group and thus bear the mark of the industry which, on the merits, would be checked by the authorities based in Parma, Italy.
