The International Atomic Energy Agency (IAEA) contains new indications of a nuclear programme developed by Syria.
But this country refuses to take a position on this, much less to comply with the controls of the agency.
On the night from 5 to 6 September 2007, around mid-night, at least four Israeli fighter planes attacked a mysterious cubic-shaped building on Syrian territory.
